00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:20.280
BAGIAN 3. ANGIN SENDALU KUAT

00:24:20.360 --> 00:24:21.840
- Ayo.
- Sial!

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:23.520
Sial!

00:24:25.200 --> 00:24:26.640
Astaga.

